  "content": "<h1><strong>简介</strong></h1><p><img src=\"https://i.imgur.com/jOGOs3T.png\" alt=\"盗贼之鱼横幅\"></p><p><a href=\"https://discord.gg/4bAj4mkGag\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://img.shields.io/discord/356400329086205953?color=00dabc&amp;label=discord&amp;logo=discord&amp;logoColor=00dabc&amp;style=for-the-badge\" alt=\"Discord\"></a></p><p><a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/fish-of-thieves\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://cf.way2muchnoise.eu/versions/568372.svg\" alt=\"CurseForge\"></a>\n<a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/fish-of-thieves\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://cf.way2muchnoise.eu/full_568372_downloads.svg\" alt=\"CurseForge\"></a></p><p><a href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=https%253a%252f%252fmodrinth.com%252fmod%252ffish-of-thieves\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://img.shields.io/modrinth/game-versions/fish-of-thieves?label=Available for\" alt=\"Modrinth\"></a>\n<a href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=https%253a%252f%252fmodrinth.com%252fmod%252ffish-of-thieves\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://img.shields.io/modrinth/dt/fish-of-thieves\" alt=\"Modrinth\"></a></p><hr><table>\n<thead>\n<tr>\n<th>Minecraft 版本</th>\n<th>状态</th>\n</tr>\n</thead>\n<tbody>\n<tr>\n<td>1.20.1</td>\n<td>✅ 活跃</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>1.21.1</td>\n<td>✅ 活跃</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>1.21.11</td>\n<td>✅ 活跃</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>26.1.x</td>\n<td>✅ 活跃</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody>\n</table><h2><strong>关于</strong></h2><p>海盗们好啊！你是否曾想过，如果把《盗贼之海》中的鱼类带入《我的世界》会是什么样子？现在它来了！</p><p>本模组以《我的世界》的风格添加了来自《盗贼之海》的鱼类、果树和新的植物生态。未来还会有更多内容！</p><p>如果你是《盗贼之海》的玩家并且对鱼类背景故事很了解，欢迎提供反馈！</p><hr><h2><strong>维基</strong></h2><p>可以在此处找到 <a href=\"https://github.com/SteveKunG/FishOfThieves/wiki\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\">维基页面</a>。</p><hr><h2><strong>截图</strong></h2><p><img src=\"https://i.imgur.com/jkdmCjN.png\" alt=\"温暖海洋中的溅尾鱼\"></p><p><img src=\"https://i.imgur.com/gLVGWOV.png\" alt=\"河流中的池塘鱼\"></p><p><img src=\"https://i.imgur.com/FNKczrj.png\" alt=\"海洋遗迹周围的古鳞鱼\"></p><p><img src=\"https://i.imgur.com/dNVnNgy.png\" alt=\"珊瑚礁周围的野溅鱼\"></p><p><img src=\"https://i.imgur.com/VwyAl67.png\" alt=\"沉船周围的沉船鱼\"></p><p><img width=\"1920\" height=\"1081\" alt=\"带饵鱼钩\" src=\"https://github.com/user-attachments/assets/7e23df75-e1f6-4554-9706-9734b8384bb9\"><br></p><p><img width=\"1920\" height=\"1081\" alt=\"宝藏鱼\" src=\"https://github.com/user-attachments/assets/bf7c118f-ba48-49c7-9875-6c6e6b4c3720\"><br></p><p><img width=\"1920\" height=\"1081\" alt=\"海哨站的鱼群\" src=\"https://github.com/user-attachments/assets/e4080f69-5514-4420-a869-94651d308171\"><br></p><p><img width=\"1920\" height=\"1081\" alt=\"宝藏鱼地图\" src=\"https://github.com/user-attachments/assets/a50c0489-b07e-4c69-ad6a-676f0750b27b\"><br></p><p><img src=\"https://i.imgur.com/Ly2BYkX.png\" alt=\"海滩上的椰子树\"></p><p><img src=\"https://i.imgur.com/nYAxlpI.png\" alt=\"香蕉树\"></p><p><img src=\"https://i.imgur.com/0eSSWlB.png\" alt=\"芒果树\"></p><p><img src=\"https://i.imgur.com/r86P4tC.png\" alt=\"新植物生态\"></p><p><img src=\"https://i.imgur.com/R4x88um.png\" alt=\"菠萝\"></p><p><img src=\"https://i.imgur.com/cktvxr3.png\" alt=\"守护者果树\"></p><hr><h2><strong>安装</strong></h2><h3><strong>Fabric</strong></h3><ul>\n<li>需要安装 <a href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=https%253a%252f%252ffabricmc.net%252fuse%252finstaller%252f\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\">Fabric Loader</a>、<a href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=https%253a%252f%252fmodrinth.com%252fmod%252ffabric-api\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\">Fabric API</a> 和 <a href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=https%253a%252f%252fmodrinth.com%252fmod%252fcloth-config\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\">Cloth Config</a></li>\n<li>安装 <a href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=https%253a%252f%252fmodrinth.com%252fmod%252fmodmenu\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\">Mod Menu</a>（可选，用于游戏内配置）</li>\n<li>安装 <a href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=https%253a%252f%252fmodrinth.com%252fmod%252fterrablender\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\">TerraBlender</a>（可选，但生成热带岛屿生物群系时需要）</li>\n</ul><h3><strong>Forge (1.20.1)</strong></h3><ul>\n<li>需要安装 <a href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=https%253a%252f%252ffiles.minecraftforge.net%252fnet%252fminecraftforge%252fforge%252f\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\">Minecraft Forge</a> 和 <a href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=https%253a%252f%252fmodrinth.com%252fmod%252fcloth-config\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\">Cloth Config</a></li>\n<li>安装 <a href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=https%253a%252f%252fmodrinth.com%252fmod%252fterrablender\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\">TerraBlender</a>（可选，但生成热带岛屿生物群系时需要）</li>\n</ul><h3><strong>NeoForge</strong></h3><ul>\n<li>需要安装 <a href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=https%253a%252f%252fprojects.neoforged.net%252fneoforged%252fneoforge\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\">NeoForge</a> 和 <a href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=https%253a%252f%252fmodrinth.com%252fmod%252fcloth-config\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\">Cloth Config</a></li>\n<li>安装 <a href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=https%253a%252f%252fmodrinth.com%252fmod%252fterrablender\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\">TerraBlender</a>（可选，但生成热带岛屿生物群系时需要）</li>\n</ul><hr><h2><strong>常见问题</strong></h2><p><strong>我可以在我的整合包中使用这个模组吗？</strong></p><p>当然可以！请务必注明出处，且不要声称是你自己的作品。</p><p><strong>如果《盗贼之海》在游戏中引入了新的鱼类，你会添加它们吗？</strong></p><p>会的，但我们会视情况而定。</p><p><strong>模组什么时候会更新到 [在此处插入版本]？</strong></p><p>会的，为什么不呢。</p><p><strong>你会向后移植到旧版本吗？</strong></p><p>不会。</p><hr><h2><strong>免责声明</strong></h2><p>我与 Rare Ltd. 或 Microsoft 没有关联。这纯粹是一个粉丝创作。</p><p>所有鱼类名称和外观均属于 Rare Ltd.。</p>",
